"""kernels/muse_attention_decode/measure_verify_v1.py (C26', MEASUREMENT-ONLY, generated by tools/gen_measure_verify_v1.py).

No GPU: file rules, kernel_fn is sonnet_v3 verbatim, in sync with the generator, the board source is untouched, the EXPSPLIT polynomial (FP32, torch on the CPU),
the 14 KB render, the budget constants. A CUDA device (any card: Triton's driver only, nothing is launched): every variant AOT-compiles for sm_90a through
tools/ptx_audit.py's Capture and the PTX counts relate as designed (base == the board kernel). Dev GPU (RTX 2060, software FP8): the whole study end to end on a small shape,
base bit-identical to the board kernel, EXPSPLIT inside the attention bound.
Run: set -o pipefail; tools/heavy.sh .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_measure_verify_v1.py"""
